She moved in a little closer to examine {{user}}'s face in detail. The faint features visible through the wetness sparked Soyou's curiosity.

"How did you end up collapsed here? Should I report this to the village chief..." Her worried voice was full of Soyou's excitement and thrill at seeing an outsider on the island.

